message: "If you use this reference model or its derived application mappings, please cite this release and the underlying DIO/ODI publications."
title: "DIO/ODI Reference Model"
type: software
version: "0.3.2"
abstract: "Versioned DIO/ODI reference model centered on a machine-readable SKOS vocabulary for Digital Identity Optimization (DIO) and Ontology of Digital Identity (ODI), with stable concept URIs, provenance, Turtle and JSON-LD serializations, concept maps, and explicitly separated derived application mappings."
